    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9fAdd in WishList!!\ud83d\udc9f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This game is the all-ages version of &quot;Yusha Prototype&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506060/extras/136cc34c790f370baf298245f5f6a2e4.avif?t=1754594852\" /></span><br>Yusha Prototype -Family Friendly- is a sidescrolling action game.<br>You are a warrior with the codename &quot;Yusha&quot;. You must explore the dungeon and find your target.<br>Use your incredible skills to defeat the monsters and bosses that reside in the depths! Get stronger, gain new items, learn new moves, and discover the truth!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506060/extras/97e0a9d9b2a17a26275785af6fbf752d.avif?t=1754594852\" /></span><br>Legend has it that long ago, a powerful Witch cast a powerful curse upon this world.<br>You are the &quot;Yusha&quot;, a fearless warrior that has accepted the mission to defeat the Witch, which brings you to this dungeon...<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506060/extras/e0b548950d89dd48a67a80f49596a542.poster.avif?t=1754594852\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506060/extras/e0b548950d89dd48a67a80f49596a542.gif?t=1754594852\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>As you navigate through each treacherous cavern, the dungeon slowly reveals its structure and secrets.<br>Ugly truths emerge about the Curse and the Witch you're supposed to defeat.<br>Who is your real enemy, and who's been feeding you lies?<br>Defeat the enemies before you, gain power, and discover the truth!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Larger-than-life defeat animations</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat special enemies and make their abilities yours!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506060/extras/220655a1e38ac34713c6e8d4e32ecf8f.poster.avif?t=1754594852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506060/extras/220655a1e38ac34713c6e8d4e32ecf8f.webm?t=1754594852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506060/extras/220655a1e38ac34713c6e8d4e32ecf8f.mp4?t=1754594852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506060/extras/3d02b5a13ad40ef71f404b0cbfdab994.poster.avif?t=1754594852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506060/extras/3d02b5a13ad40ef71f404b0cbfdab994.webm?t=1754594852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506060/extras/3d02b5a13ad40ef71f404b0cbfdab994.mp4?t=1754594852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506060/extras/e33132a0c5ea44c053a886cfe6dbea20.poster.avif?t=1754594852\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506060/extras/e33132a0c5ea44c053a886cfe6dbea20.webm?t=1754594852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506060/extras/e33132a0c5ea44c053a886cfe6dbea20.mp4?t=1754594852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
